  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme development and policy advising on economic growth and sustainable poverty reduction including response to shocks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Initiation Plan will (i) foster research ideas on human-centred policy options, including but not limited to inclusive and equitable access to economic development opportunities, social services and benefits, digital transformation, and renewable energy; (ii) engage government officials, academic institutions, the business community and civil society in inclusive discussions of economic affairs, socio-economic development policies and national development plans and strategies to help build a national consensus in support of a development process that leaves no one behind; (iii) identify gaps in programming via stakeholder consultations to design and implement new programmes on inclusive and sustainable growth, (iv) cash assistance to communities and technical assistance to local businesses which have been affected by the typhoon in Ha Giang.</narrative>
  </description>
